{"meta":{"stage":"06-mirror-prs","source_org":"cyberfabric","target_org":null,"first_run_at":"2026-06-01T10:11:25Z","last_run_at":"2026-06-01T10:11:25Z"},"stats":{"total":203,"synced":0,"pending":0,"failed":0},"items":[{"source_pr_number":175,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/175","source_state":"closed","source_author":"azumenok","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #175] Change prek to husky","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"feature/change-prek","pr_head_sha":"6c44c577add2245733f5ac54b7f1c959d66fd113","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"azumenok","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/175","id":3330590237,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQBxSA87GhMYd","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/175","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/175.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/175.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/issues/175","number":175,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Change prek to husky","user":{"login":"azumenok","id":264127015,"node_id":"U_kgDOD75CJw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264127015?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/azumenok","html_url":"https://github.com/azumenok","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azumenok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azumenok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azumenok/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azumenok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azumenok/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azumenok/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azumenok/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azumenok/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azumenok/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Hi, I propose to change binary dependency [prek](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@j178/prek) to well known [husky](https://www.npmjs.com/package/husky).\r\n\r\nprek is a third-party dependency — husky is the de-facto standard, widely maintained, and already in the ecosystem. Removing prek reduces [dependency surface](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@j178/prek?activeTab=dependencies).\r\nprek's built-in hooks (trailing whitespace, end-of-file, JSON/YAML validation) were replaced by scripts/lint-staged-checks.mjs – full control over the logic without depending on prek's internals.","created_at":"2026-02-26T11:47:16Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T16:30:54Z","closed_at":"2026-02-27T16:30:54Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e68de06e824654153618e51e6a792428b981e1fc","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/175/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/175/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/issues/175/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/statuses/6c44c577add2245733f5ac54b7f1c959d66fd113","head":{"label":"azumenok:feature/change-prek","ref":"feature/change-prek","sha":"6c44c577add2245733f5ac54b7f1c959d66fd113","user":{"login":"azumenok","id":264127015,"node_id":"U_kgDOD75CJw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264127015?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/azumenok","html_url":"https://github.com/azumenok","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azumenok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.co