s/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/qodo-code-review","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-17T17:15:56Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T17:15:56Z","body":"<h3>Review Summary by Qodo</h3>\n\nMicrofrontend (MFE) Implementation with Runtime Orchestration and Bidirectional Communication\n\n<code>✨ Enhancement</code> <code>🧪 Tests</code>\n\n<img src=\"https://www.qodo.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/light-grey-line.svg\" height=\"10%\" alt=\"Grey Divider\">\n\n<h3>Walkthroughs</h3>\n\n<details open>\n<summary>Description</summary>\n\n<br/>\n\n<pre>\n• Implements comprehensive Microfrontend (MFE) architecture with runtime orchestration, lifecycle\n  management, and bidirectional communication\n• Adds <b><i>DefaultScreensetsRegistry</i></b> concrete implementation (652 lines) wiring together\n  ExtensionManager, MountManager, LifecycleManager, and ActionsChainsMediator for full MFE\n  orchestration\n• Implements <b><i>DefaultActionsChainsMediator</i></b> for executing action chains with success/failure\n  branching, timeout management, and handler registration\n• Implements <b><i>DefaultExtensionManager</i></b> for domain and extension registration, validation, and\n  lifecycle triggering with cascade unregistration\n• Adds <b><i>ParentMfeBridgeImpl</i></b> for bidirectional parent-child MFE communication with property updates\n  and actions chain delivery\n• Creates theme resolution modules for both blank-mfe and demo-mfe packages with 5 complete theme\n  objects (default, dark, light, dracula, dracula-large)\n• Refactors React provider types: replaces <b><i>router</i></b> prop with <b><i>mfeBridge</i></b> in <b><i>HAI3ProviderProps</i></b> for\n  MFE component integration\n• Removes legacy routing/navigation infrastructure (routing plugin, navigation hooks, route\n  registry, screenset CLI generators)\n• Adds extensive test coverage (30+ test suites) for MFE runtime, lifecycle, validation, bridge\n  communication, error handling, and plugin integration\n• Updates package documentation to reflect MFE focus and removes unused imports\n• Cleans up unused tenant effects imports\n</pre>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Diagram</summary>\n\n<br/>\n\n>\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  A[\"HAI3 Framework\"] -->|\"mfeBridge prop\"| B[\"React Provider\"]\n  B -->|\"instantiates\"| C[\"ScreensetsRegistry\"]\n  C -->|\"orchestrates\"| D[\"ExtensionManager\"]\n  C -->|\"orchestrates\"| E[\"MountManager\"]\n  C -->|\"orchestrates\"| F[\"LifecycleManager\"]\n  C -->|\"orchestrates\"| G[\"ActionsChainsMediator\"]\n  C -->|\"creates\"| H[\"ParentMfeBridge\"]\n  H -->|\"bidirectional\"| I[\"ChildMfeBridge\"]\n  D -->|\"manages\"| J[\"Domains & Extensions\"]\n  G -->|\"executes\"| K[\"Action Chains\"]\n  J -->|\"applies\"| L[\"Themes\"]\n```\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://www.qodo.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/light-grey-line.svg\" height=\"10%\" alt=\"Grey Divider\">\n\n<h3>File Changes</h3>\n\n<details>\n<summary>1. src/mfe_packages/_blank-mfe/src/shared/themes.ts\n <code>✨ Enhancement</code> <code> +675/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Theme resolution module with multiple theme definitions\n><pre>\n>• Created comprehensive theme definitions module with 5 complete theme objects (default, dark,\n>  light, dracula, dracula-large)\n>• Each theme includes detailed color palettes, spacing, typography, border radius, shadows, and\n>  transitions\n>• Exported <b><i>THEME_MAP</i></b> record mapping theme IDs to Theme objects for runtime resolution\n>• Implemented <b><i>resolveTheme()</i></b> function to retrieve themes by ID string from domain properties\n></pre>\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/HAI3org/HAI3/pull/168/files#diff-aa3b794832a0a83890d87e8e795132fb69b69a778158267f39c18fadc46e13a0'> src/mfe_packages/_blank-mfe/src/shared/themes.ts\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>2. src/mfe_packages/demo-mfe/src/shared/themes.ts\n <code>✨ Enhancement</code> <code> +675/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Theme resolution module with multiple theme definitions\n><pre>\n>• Created identical theme definitions module as blank-mfe for demo MFE package\n>• Includes 5 complete theme objects with consistent color schemes and design tokens\n>• Exported <b><i>THEME_MAP</i></b> and <b><i>resolveTheme()</i></b> function for theme resolution\n>• Ensures MFE independence by inlining all theme definitions without host imports\n></pre>\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/HAI3org/HAI3/pull/168/files#diff-8e0b8ec9dfa031c29ce855aa82efa126f3e53c1f148b66738fc07cfaa0e23862'> src/mfe_packages/demo-mfe/src/shared/themes.ts\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>3. packages/screensets/__tests__/mfe/mediator/actions-chains-mediator.test.ts\n <code>🧪 Tests</code> <code> +792/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>ActionsChainsMediator test suite with execution and timeout tests\n><pre>\n>• Added comprehensive test suite for <b><i>DefaultActionsChainsMediator</i></b> covering Phase 9 requirements\n>• Tests cover success path execution, failure path execution, chain termination, payload validation,\n>  and handler lifecycle\n>• Implemented timeout handling tests including domain default timeout and action-level timeout\n>  override\n>• Added tests for <b><i>ChainExecutionOptions</i></b> with <b><i>chainTimeout</i></b> parameter support\n></pre>\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/HAI3org/HAI3/pull/168/files#diff-b14a0d7627376fcdccb53f59fe4b48d7a3ce676536917668f93eeaf8250c61dc'> packages/screensets/__tests__/mfe/mediator/actions-chains-mediator.test.ts\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details><summary><ins><strong>View more (121)</strong></ins></summary><br/>\n<details>\n<summary>4. packages/screensets/__tests__/mfe/handler/mf-handler.test.ts\n <code>🧪 Tests</code> <code> +457/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>MfeHandlerMF caching and manifest resolution test suite\n><pre>\n>• Created test suite for <b><i>MfeHandlerMF</i></b> Phase 17 internal caching functionality\n>• Tests verify manifest caching, container caching per <b><i>remoteName</i></b>, and manifest resolution from\n>  both inline objects and type ID references\n>• Includes error handling tests for missing manifest fields and invalid configurations\n>• Validates caching integration across multiple entries from the same remote\n></pre>\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/HAI3org/HAI3/pull/168/files#diff-29388437b23a1e2db8b1f2593563f8afcca7b352ab53d504b2e25d7daa1d6d5f'> packages/screensets/__tests__/mfe/handler/mf-handler.test.ts\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>5. packages/react/src/types.ts\n <code>✨ Enhancement</code> <code> +13/-155 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Type definitions refactoring for MFE bridge support\n><pre>\n>• Removed <b><i>RouterType</i></b> and <b><i>RouterConfig</i></b> type definitions and related documentation\n>• Removed re-exports of <b><i>LanguageMetadata</i></b>, <b><i>MenuItemConfig</i></b>, <b><i>ScreensetDefinition</i></b>,\n>  <b><i>ScreensetCategory</i></b>\n>• Added <b><i>MfeContextValue</i></b> import and type for MFE bridge support\n>• Updated <b><i>HAI3ProviderProps</i></b> to replace <b><i>router</i></b> prop with <b><i>mfeBridge</i></b> for MFE component\n>  integration\n>• Changed <b><i>setLanguage</i></b> return type from <b><i>Promise&lt;void&gt;</i></b> to <b><i>void</i></b> in <b><i>UseTranslationReturn</i></b>\n></pre>\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/HAI3org/HAI3/pull/168/files#diff-84f256c9526675be4ce59318afe5f494f4ef705bc836911864ff1f4f6159602d'> packages/react/src/types.ts\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>6. packages/framework/src/effects/tenantEffects.ts\n <code>🐞 Bug fix</code> <code> +1/-33 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Cleanup of unused tenant effects import\n><pre>\n>• Removed unused import of <b><i>setTenantLoading</i></b> from <b><i>tenantSlice</i></b>\n>• Kept imports for <b><i>setTenant</i></b> and <b><i>clearTenant</i></b> which are actively used\n></pre>\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/HAI3org/HAI3/pull/168/files#diff-5db25ebe23522a3e938242f561844858e6eb84e488dca037e4fa96d3e28f32b0'> packages/framework/src/effects/tenantEffects.ts\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>7. packages/screensets/src/mfe/runtime/DefaultScreensetsRegistry.ts\n <code>✨ Enhancement</code> <code> +652/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Concrete MFE Runtime Implementation with Full Collaborator Wiring\n><pre>\n>• Implements concrete MFE runtime with 652 lines of initialization, delegation, and lifecycle\n>  management\n>• Wires together collaborators (ExtensionManager, MountManager, LifecycleManager,\n>  ActionsChainsMediator) for full MFE orchestration\n>• Provides public API for domain/extension registration, lifecycle triggering, and actions chain\n>  execution\n>• Implements concurrency control via <b><i>OperationSerializer</i></b> and resource cleanup via <b><i>dispose()</i></b>\n></pre>\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/HAI3org/HAI3/pull/168/files#diff-be04bc91f7a1e7386e778f92f8f2e977f080ace595a0a0bb73db123dd6c0ea7b'> packages/screensets/src/mfe/runtime/DefaultScreensetsRegistry.ts\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>8. packages/screensets/__tests__/mfe/runtime/extension-lifecycle-actions.test.ts\n <code>🧪 Tests</code> <code> +626/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Extension Lifecycle Actions Handler Tests with Semantics\n><pre>\n>• Tests <b><i>ExtensionLifecycleActionHandler</i></b> for three lifecycle actions: <b><i>load_ext</i></b>, <b><i>mount_ext</i></b>,\n>  <b><i>unmount_ext</i></b>\n>• Validates toggle vs swap semantics for domain mount behavior (unmount before mount in swap mode)\n>• Tests container provider integration and error handling for missing payloads\n>• Verifies domain handler auto-registration and lifecycle callback routing\n></pre>\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/HAI3org/HAI3/pull/168/files#diff-3cd7d4df0d2140694981c62fdc3cebd8450663c526e433bfd21ac618b1b5a30d'> packages/screensets/__tests__/mfe/runtime/extension-lifecycle-actions.test.ts\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>9. packages/screensets/__tests__/mfe/bridge/bridge.test.ts\n <code>🧪 Tests</code> <code> +518/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Bridge Implementation Tests for Bidirectional MFE Communication\n><pre>\n>• Tests bidirectional bridge communication between parent and child MFEs\n>• Validates property subscription/update flow and actions chain delivery in both directions\n>• Tests bridge disposal, cleanup, and error handling for disposed bridges\n>• Verifies <b><i>executeActionsChain</i></b> callback wiring and parent-to-child action delivery\n></pre>\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/HAI3org/HAI3/pull/168/files#diff-5f05916cc1c0bde22c55e6de3a4ed96aee390bf7d763ac258400c0217813ac7a'> packages/screensets/__tests__/mfe/bridge/bridge.test.ts\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>10. packages/screensets/__tests__/mfe/runtime/dynamic-registration.test.ts\n <code>🧪 Tests</code> <code> +521/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Dynamic Extension and Domain Registration Tests\n><pre>\n>• Tests dynamic registration/unregistration of extensions and domains at runtime\n>• Valid