 building locally, new `.vitepress` folder is created in `src`. Any idea why this happens?","created_at":"2026-02-06T14:40:24Z","updated_at":"2026-02-06T14:40:29Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/157#discussion_r2774493934","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/157","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/comments/2774493934"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/157#discussion_r2774493934"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/157"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/comments/2774493934/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1,"original_line":1,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":1,"position":1,"subject_type":"file"}],"source_reviews":[{"id":3738244668,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOQBxSA87e0RY8","user":{"login":"GeraBart","id":246844849,"node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?u=a983485ea6e632a911c48b8dc160937e6252ae5d&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# PR #157 Review - Documentation vs Implementation Inconsistencies\n\n## Executive Summary\n\n**33 issues found** → **Consolidated to 26 distinct issues**\n\n- **15 Critical issues** - APIs that don't exist or have wrong signatures\n- **7 High priority issues** - Wrong names or missing functionality\n- **4 Medium priority issues** - Configuration and terminology mismatches\n\n**Verification Status:** All issues have been cross-checked against actual implementation. Every reported mismatch is confirmed accurate.\n\n---\n\n## Critical Issues - Block Merge\n\n### Issue 1: `createHAI3()` - Wrong Type and Fields\n\n**Files:** `api-reference/framework.md` (line 17)\n\n**Documented:**\n```typescript\nfunction createHAI3(options?: AppOptions): AppBuilder\n// AppOptions: { id, name, version, env, logLevel }\n```\n\n**Actual:**\n```typescript\nfunction createHAI3(config?: HAI3Config): HAI3AppBuilder\n// HAI3Config: { name, devMode, strictMode, autoNavigate, base, routerMode }\n```\n\n**Fix:** Replace `AppOptions` with `HAI3Config` and update all field references.\n\n---\n\n### Issue 2: `createPlugin()` Function Doesn't Exist\n\n**Files:**\n- `api-reference/framework.md` (lines 109-146)\n- `concepts/plugins.md` (lines 128-144, throughout)\n- `guides/api-integration.md` (API plugin examples)\n- `architecture/app.md` (plugin registration)\n\n**Documented:**\n```typescript\nconst myPlugin = createPlugin({\n  id: 'my-plugin',\n  name: 'My Plugin',\n  initialize: (app) => { /* ... */ }\n});\n```\n\n**Actual:**\n- No `createPlugin()` function exists in `@hai3/framework`\n- Plugins are plain objects conforming to `HAI3Plugin` interface\n- Created directly by factory functions (e.g., `layout()`, `screensets()`)\n\n**Fix:** Remove all `createPlugin()` references. Document actual plugin pattern with factory functions.\n\n---\n\n### Issue 3: Plugin Lifecycle - `initialize` vs `onRegister`/`onInit`/`onDestroy`\n\n**Files:**\n- `api-reference/framework.md` (plugin lifecycle sections)\n- `concepts/plugins.md` (throughout)\n\n**Documented:** Plugins use `initialize()` method\n\n**Actual:** Plugins use:\n- `onRegister(registry: HAI3Registry): void`\n- `onInit(app: HAI3App): void`\n- `onDestroy(): void`\n\n**Fix:** Update all lifecycle method names throughout plugin documentation.\n\n---\n\n### Issue 4: `useEventBus()` Hook Doesn't Exist\n\n**Files:**\n- `api-reference/react.md` (lines 192-228)\n- `architecture/react.md` (hook examples)\n- `TERMINOLOGY.md` (lines 415-425, extension examples)\n\n**Documented:**\n```typescript\nconst eventBus = useEventBus();\n```\n\n**Actual:**\n- No `useEventBus()` hook in `@hai3/react`\n- Import `eventBus` directly from `@hai3/framework`\n\n**Fix:**\n```typescript\nimport { eventBus } from '@hai3/framework';\n// Use directly, no hook needed\n```\n\n---\n\n### Issue 5: `useScreensetNavigation()` Should Be `useNavigation()`\n\n**Files:**\n- `api-reference/react.md` (lines 268-302)\n- `concepts/screensets.md` (lines 206-221)\n- `guides/creating-screensets.md` (line 173)\n- `architecture/react.md` (hook examples)\n\n**Documented:** `useScreensetNavigation()`\n\n**Actual:** `useNavigation()` (exported from `@hai3/react`)\n\n**Fix:** Global find/replace `useScreensetNavigation` → `useNavigation`\n\n---\n\n### Issue 6: `useHAI3App()` Should Be `useHAI3()`\n\n**Files:**\n- `api-reference/react.md` (lines 304-330)\n- `architecture/react.md` (hook examples)\n\n**Documented:** `useHAI3App()`\n\n**Actual:** `useHAI3()` (exported from `@hai3/react`)\n\n**Fix:** Global find/replace `useHAI3App` → `useHAI3`\n\n---\n\n### Issue 7: `useRegistry()` Hook Doesn't Exist\n\n**Files:**\n- `api-reference/react.md` (lines 332-364)\n\n**Documented:**\n```typescript\nconst registry = useRegistry<T>(name);\n```\n\n**Actual:** No such hook exists\n\n**Fix:**\n```typescript\nconst app = useHAI3();\nconst registry = app.getRegistry();\n```\n\n---\n\n### Issue 8: `useScreenParams()` Should Be `useRouteParams()`\n\n**Files:**\n- `api-reference/react.md` (parameter access)\n- `guides/creating-screensets.md` (parameter examples)\n- `concepts/screensets.md` (line 251)\n\n**Documented:** `useScreenParams()`\n\n**Actual:** `useRouteParams()` (exported from `@hai3/react`)\n\n**Fix:** Global find/replace `useScreenParams` → `useRouteParams`\n\n---\n\n### Issue 9: `<HAI3App>` Component Doesn't Exist\n\n**Files:**\n- `api-reference/react.md` (lines 41-71)\n- `getting-started.md` (potentially in quick start)\n\n**Documented:**\n```tsx\n<HAI3App\n  screensets={[...]}\n  initialScreenset=\"dashboard\"\n  theme=\"light\"\n  plugins={[...]}\n/>\n```\n\n**Actual:** Component doesn't exist in `@hai3/react/components`\n\n**Note:** `HAI3App` exists as a **type** for the app instance, creating naming confusion.\n\n**Fix:** Remove component documentation OR implement the component.\n\n---\n\n### Issue 10: `<Screen>` Component Doesn't Exist\n\n**Files:**\n- `api-reference/react.md` (lines 99-130)\n\n**Documented:** `<Screen>` wrapper component with props\n\n**Actual:** No such component exists in React package\n\n**Fix:** Remove documentation or clarify this is a pattern, not a component.\n\n---\n\n### Issue 11: CLI Commands Don't Exist\n\n**Files:** `api-reference/cli.md`\n\n**Documented commands that DON'T exist:**\n- `hai3 generate screenset <name>` (line 105)\n- `hai3 generate screen <screenset>/<name>` (lines 106-137)\n- `hai3 generate service <name>` (lines 139-172)\n- `hai3 generate slice <name>` (lines 173-199)\n- `hai3 dev` (lines 201-218)\n- `hai3 build` (lines 220-236)\n- `hai3 info` (lines 279-293)\n\n**Actual commands:**\n```bash\nhai3 create <project-name>\nhai3 screenset create <name>        # NOT \"generate screenset\"\nhai3 screenset copy <source> <target>\nhai3 validate components [path]\nhai3 scaffold layout\nhai3 migrate [version]\nhai3 ai sync\nhai3 update [packages|layout]\n```\n\n**Fix:** Complete rewrite of CLI documentation to match actual commands.\n\n---\n\n### Issue 12: `defineScreenset()` Function Doesn't Exist\n\n**Files:**\n- `concepts/screensets.md` (lines 37-49, 133-148)\n- `guides/creating-screensets.md` (all examples)\n- `architecture/sdk/screensets.md` (architecture examples)\n- `TERMINOLOGY.md` (lines 306-317, extension examples)\n\n**Documented:**\n```typescript\nimport { defineScreenset } from '@hai3/screensets';\nexport const dashboardScreenset = defineScreenset({ ... });\n```\n\n**Actual:**\n- No `defineScreenset()` function exported\n- `/packages/screensets/src/index.ts` only exports types\n- Screensets are plain objects of type `ScreensetDefinition`\n\n**Fix:**\n```typescript\nimport type { ScreensetDefinition } from '@hai3/screensets';\nexport const dashboardScreenset: ScreensetDefinition = { ... };\n```\n\n---\n\n## High Priority Issues\n\n### Issue 13: Presets Configuration - `headless` Misdescribed\n\n**Files:** `api-reference/framework.md` (preset section)\n\n**Documented:** `presets.headless` = \"No UI, API and state only\"\n\n**Actual:** Only includes screensets plugin (not API/state)\n\n**Fix:** Correct description to match actual preset contents.\n\n---\n\n### Issue 14: Plugin Factory Names Don't Match\n\n**Files:** Various configuration examples\n\n**Documented:** References like `apiPlugin`, `layoutPlugin` with generic config objects\n\n**Actual:**\n- Plugins use specific factory names: `layout()`, `screensets()`, `themes()`, etc.\n- Configuration structures differ per plugin\n\n**Fix:** Review all plugin config examples against actual factory signatures.\n\n---\n\n### Issue 15: Quick Start May Use Non-Existent APIs\n\n**Files:** `getting-started.md` (code examples)\n\n**Potential issues:**\n- May reference `<HAI3App>` component\n- May use `createPlugin()`\n- May use wrong hook names\n\n**Fix:** Audit all code examples in getting-started against actual APIs.\n\n---\n\n### Issue 16: Missing Commands Documentation\n\n**Files:** `api-reference/cli.md`\n\n**Commands that exist but aren't documented:**\n```bash\nhai3 screenset copy <source> <target>\nhai3 validate components [path]\nhai3 scaffold layout\nhai3 migrate [version]\nhai3 ai sync\nhai3 update layout\n```\n\n**Fix:** Add documentation for these existing commands.\n\n---\n\n### Issue 17: Hook Names Inconsistent in Architecture Docs\n\n**Files:** `architecture/react.md` (throughout)\n\n**Issues:**\n- Uses `useHAI3App()` instead of `useHAI3()`\n- Uses `useScreensetNavigation()` instead of `useNavigation()`\n- References `useEventBus()` which doesn't exist\n\n**Fix:** Update all hook references to actual names.\n\n---\n\n### Issue 18: Complete Plugin Documentation Rewrite Needed\n\n**Files:** `concepts/plugins.md` (entire file)\n\n**Cumulative issues:**\n1. Uses `createPlugin()` which doesn't exist\n2. Uses `initialize` instead of actual lifecycle\n3. Config examples don't match actual plugin APIs\n\n**Fix:** Rewrite plugin documentation from scratch based on actual implementation:\n- Document real plugin factories\n- Show correct lifecycle (onRegister/onInit/onDestroy)\n- Provide actual plugin patterns from codebase\n\n---\n\n### Issue 19: Missing Real Plugins Documentation\n\n**Files:** `concepts/plugins.md`\n\n**Missing plugins that exist:**\n\n1. **Mock Plugin** (`@hai3/framework`)\n   - `mock()` factory function\n   - Centralized mock control\n   - `toggleMockMode()` action\n   - Development feature\n\n2. **Effects Plugin** (`@hai3/framework`)\n   - `effects()` factory function\n   - Effect coordination\n   - Required for mock plugin\n\n**Fix:** Add documentation sections for these plugins.\n\n---\n\n## Medium Priority Issues\n\n### Issue 20: Type vs Interface Naming Confusion\n\n**Files:** Multiple\n\n**Issue:** `HAI3App` refers to:\n1. The app instance interface type (exists)\n2. A React component (doesn't exist)\n\n**Fix:** Clarify terminology - `HAI3App` is a type only.\n\n---\n\n### Issue 21: TERMINOLOGY.md Uses Non-Existent APIs in Examples\n\n**Files:** `TERMINOLOGY.md`\n\n**Issues:**\n- Line 306-317: Uses `defineScreenset()`\n- Line 326-336: Uses `createPlugin()`\n- Line 415-425: Uses `useEventBus()`\n\n**Fix:** Update all code examples in glossary to use actual APIs.\n\n---\n\n### Issue 22: Missing Route Parameters Documentation\n\n**Files:** None (gap in documentation)\n\n**Missing:**\n- `useRouteParams<TScreenId>()` hook with type-safe params\n- `RouteParamsProvider` and `RouteParamsContext`\n- Module augmentation pattern\n- Type-safe routing examples\n\n**Fix:** Add route parameters section to React API reference.\n\n---\n\n### Issue 23: Broken Navigation Link\n\n**Files:** `.vitepress/config.ts` (line 118)\n\n**Issue:** References `/hai3/guides/getting-started` which doesn't exist\n\n**Actual:** Getting started is at root level: `/getting-started`\n\n**Fix:** Update config link or move file.\n\n---\n\n## Summary Table\n\n| Issue | Type | Files Affected | Severity |\n|-------|------|----------------|----------|\n| createHAI3() wrong type | API signature | 1 | Critical |\n| createPlugin() missing | Non-existent API | 4 | Critical |\n| Plugin lifecycle wrong | API methods | 2 | Critical |\n| useEventBus() missing | Non-existent hook | 3 | Critical |\n| useScreensetNavigation() | Wrong name | 4 | Critical |\n| useHAI3App() | Wrong name | 2 | Critical |\n| useRegistry() missing | Non-existent hook | 1 | Critical |\n| useScreenParams() | Wrong name | 3 | Critical |\n| <HAI3App> missing | Non-existent component | 2 | Critical |\n| <Screen> missing | Non-existent component | 1 | Critical |\n| CLI commands missing | Non-existent commands | 1 (many commands) | Critical |\n| defineScreenset() missing | Non-existent function | 4 | Critical |\n| Presets misdescribed | Wrong info | 1 | High |\n| Plugin factories wrong | Wrong names | Multiple | High |\n| Quick start issues | Potential errors | 1 | High |\n| Missing CLI docs | Undocumented | 1 | High |\n| Architecture hooks wrong | Wrong names | 1 | High |\n| Plugins doc rewrite | Cumulative errors | 1 | High |\n| Missing plugins docs | Gaps | 1 | High |\n| Naming confusion | Terminology | Multiple | Medium |\n| Glossary examples wrong | Wrong APIs | 1 | Medium |\n| Route params missing | Gap | None | Medium |\n| Broken nav link | Config error | 1 | Medium |\n\n---\n\n## Recommended Action\n\n**DO NOT MERGE** until Critical issues are resolved at minimum.\n\n### Phase 1: Fix Critical Issues (Required for merge)\n1. Global replacements:\n   - `useScreensetNavigation` → `useNavigation`\n   - `useHAI3App` → `useHAI3`\n   - `useScreenParams` → `useRouteParams`\n   - `defineScreenset` → Remove, use type annotation\n   - `createPlugin` → Remove, document actual pattern\n2. Remove non-existent components: `<HAI3App>`, `<Screen>`\n3. Remove non-existent hook: `useEventBus()`\n4. Fix `createHAI3()` type and fields\n5. Rewrite CLI documentation\n\n### Phase 2: Fix High Priority (Before release)\n1. Fix plugin lifecycle documentation\n2. Fix plugin factory names\n3. Add missing CLI commands\n4. Audit getting-started examples\n5. Update architecture docs hooks\n\n### Phase 3: Clean Up (Can be post-merge)\n1. Fix terminology/naming confusion\n2. Add route parameters docs\n3. Add missing plugins docs\n4. Fix broken nav link\n\n---\n\n## Testing Checklist\n\nBefore approving PR, verify:\n\n- [ ] All code examples can be copy-pasted and run\n- [ ] All CLI commands listed actually execute\n- [ ] All hooks referenced exist with correct names\n- [ ] All components referenced exist\n- [ ] All types referenced exist with correct fields\n- [ ] No import statements reference non-existent exports\n- [ ] Quick start guide works end-to-end\n\n---\n\n## Additional Analysis: Documentation Structure\n\n### Glossary (TERMINOLOGY.md)\n\n**Status:** ✅ Excellent (9/10)\n\n**Strengths:**\n- 490 lines, 70+ terms\n- Well-organized sections\n- Code examples (though some use wrong APIs - see Issue 21)\n- Links to deeper docs\n\n**Recommendation:** Fix code examples, otherwise excellent.\n\n---\n\n### Design System Documentation\n\n**Status:** ❌ Missing - Critical Gap\n\n**What's missing:**\n- UI component design principles\n- Typography system\n- Color palette guidelines\n- Spacing/grid system\n- Iconography\n- Accessibility standards\n- Component anatomy\n- Design tokens\n\n**Impact:** High - Designers/frontend devs lack visual guidance\n\n**Recommendation:** Create `/hai3/design-system/` section in separate PR\n- Estimated effort: 2-3 weeks\n- Priority: Critical for 1.0 release\n\n---\n\n### OpenSpec Integration Opportunity\n\n**Status:** ✅ Extensive artifacts exist but not exposed\n\n**What exists:**\n- `/openspec/specs/` - 12 active capability specifications\n- `/openspec/changes/archive/` - 69 proposals, 24 design documents\n\n**Recommendation:** Expose selectively in separate PR\n- Add `/specifications/` section linking to active specs\n- Create `/architecture/decisions/` with 10-15 curated ADRs\n- Estimated effort: 1-2 weeks\n- Priority: High for contributor experience\n\n**Benefits:**\n- Single source of truth\n- Shows architectural thinking\n- Industry best practice (GraphQL, Kubernetes, Rust do this)\n\n---\n\n## Final Verdict\n\n**Documentation Quality:** 4/10 (too many critical API errors)\n\n**After fixes:** Projected 7.5/10\n\n**Strengths:**\n- Excellent structure and organization\n- Good architectural documentation\n- Comprehensive glossary\n- Clear navigation\n\n**Weaknesses:**\n- Documentation doesn't match implementation\n- Many non-existent APIs documented\n- Missing design system docs\n- CLI docs are fictional\n\n**Recommendation:** Fix Critical issues, then merge. Follow immediately with Design System and OpenSpec PRs.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/157#pullrequestreview-3738244668","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/157","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/157#pullrequestreview-3738244668"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/157"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-02T09:29:13Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3776590474,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOQBxSA87hGjKK","user":{"login":"GeraBart","id":246844849,"node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?u=a983485ea6e632a911c48b8dc160937e6252ae5d&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# PR #157 Re-Review — Documentation vs Implementation Audit\n\n## Summary\n\nGood progress on the first round of fixes. **6 of the original 23 issues are fully resolved.** However, the fixes were applied to only a subset of files (primarily `api-reference/react.md`, `api-reference/cli.md`, `concepts/plugins.md`, `getting-started.md`, `TERMINOLOGY.md`). **Many other files still contain the same incorrect APIs.**\n\nAll findings below are **verified via grep against the checked-out branch** — these are not assumptions from the diff.\n\n---\n\n## Fully Resolved Issues ✅\n\n| # | Issue | Verification |\n|---|-------|-------------|\n| 1 | `AppOptions` → `HAI3Config` | 0 occurrences of `AppOptions` |\n| 5 | `useScreensetNavigation()` → `useNavigation()` | 0 occurrences |\n| 6 | `useHAI3App()` → `useHAI3()` | 0 occurrences |\n| 7 | `useRegistry()` removed | 0 occurrences |\n| 8 | `useScreenParams()` → `useRouteParams()` | 0 occurrences |\n| 23 | Broken navigation link | Fixed in config.ts |\n\nAlso fixed: CLI documentation rewritten, presets correctly described, route params docs added, HAI3App type vs component clarified with tip boxes.\n\n---\n\n## Remaining Issues — Verified Against Checked-Out Files\n\n### Critical: `useEventBus()` — 30+ occurrences across 7 files\n\nThis hook does not exist. The event bus is a direct import: `import { eventBus } from '@hai3/framework'`.\n\n**Files still using `useEventBus()`:**\n- `hai3/guides/creating-screensets.md` (5 occurrences)\n- `hai3/architecture/react.md` (6 occurrences)\n- `hai3/concepts/event-driven.md` (13 occurrences)\n- `hai3/architecture/layers.md` (3 occurrences)\n- `case-studies/portal-microfrontend.md` (4 occurrences)\n- `hai3/contributing/guidelines.md` (1 occurrence)\n\n---\n\n### Critical: `defineScreenset()` — 30+ occurrences across 8 files\n\nThis function does not exist. Screensets are plain objects typed as `ScreensetDefinition`.\n\n**Files still using `defineScreenset()`:**\n- `hai3/architecture/sdk/screensets.md` (16 occurrences — entire file is based on this)\n- `hai3/concepts/screensets.md` (5 occurrences)\n- `hai3/guides/creating-screensets.md` (3 occurrences)\n- `hai3/architecture/layers.md` (2 occurrences)\n- `hai3/architecture/react.md` (1 occurrence)\n- `case-studies/portal-microfrontend.md` (2 occurrences)\n\n---\n\n### Critical: `screensetPlugin`/`themePlugin`/etc. — 80+ occurrences across 12 files\n\nThese plugin names don't exist. Actual names are factory functions: `screensets()`, `themes()`, `layout()`, `navigation()`, `routing()`, `i18n()`, `effects()`, `mock()`.\n\n**Most affected files:**\n- `hai3/architecture/framework.md` (40+ occurrences — entire file uses old names)\n- `hai3/api-reference/framework.md` (20+ occurrences)\n- `hai3/architecture/layers.md` (8 occurrences)\n- `hai3/architecture/overview.md` (3 occurrences)\n- `hai3/concepts/themes.md` (3 occurrences)\n- `hai3/guides/api-integration.md` (2 occurrences)\n- `hai3/architecture/sdk/i18n.md` (2 occurrences)\n- `lifecycle/technical/architecture.md` (2 occurrences)\n- `lifecycle/technical/hai3-example.md` (2 occurrences)\n\n---\n\n### Critical: `createPlugin()` — 12+ occurrences across 3 files\n\nThis function does not exist. Plugins are factory functions returning `HAI3Plugin` objects.\n\n**Files still using `createPlugin()`:**\n- `hai3/architecture/framework.md` (8 occurrences)\n- `hai3/architecture/overview.md` (2 occurrences)\n- `hai3/architecture/layers.md` (2 occurrences)\n\n---\n\n### Critical: `<HAI3App>` used as JSX component — 5 occurrences across 5 files\n\n`HAI3App` is a TypeScript type, not a React component. The component is `<HAI3Provider>`.\n\n**Files still using `<HAI3App ...>`:**\n- `hai3/architecture/react.md`\n- `hai3/architecture/app.md`\n- `hai3/architecture/layers.md`\n- `hai3/guides/creating-screensets.md`\n- `case-studies/portal-microfrontend.md`\n\n---\n\n### Critical: `app.getRegistry()` / `app.registerRegistry()` — 18+ occurrences across 5 files\n\nThese methods don't exist on `HAI3App`. Registries are direct properties: `app.screensetRegistry`, `app.themeRegistry`, `app.routeRegistry`, `app.i18nRegistry`.\n\n**Files affected:**\n- `hai3/api-reference/framework.md` (8 occurrences)\n- `hai3/architecture/framework.md` (8 occurrences)\n- `hai3/architecture/overview.md` (2 occurrences)\n- `hai3/guides/api-integration.md` (1 occurrence)\n\n---\n\n### Critical: `app.eventBus` — 9 occurrences across 5 files\n\n`HAI3App` does not have an `eventBus` property. Use `import { eventBus } from '@hai3/framework'` directly.\n\n**Files affected:**\n- `hai3/architecture/framework.md` (4 occurrences)\n- `hai3/architecture/overview.md` (1 occurrence)\n- `hai3/api-reference/framework.md` (1 occurrence)\n- `hai3/architecture/layers.md` (1 occurrence)\n- `hai3/contributing/` (2 occurrences)\n\n---\n\n### High: `app.id` — 6 occurrences across 5 files\n\n`HAI3App` does not have an `id` property.\n\n**Files:** `api-reference/framework.md`, `api-reference/react.md`, `architecture/framework.md`, `architecture/react.md`, `architecture/layers.md`\n\n---\n\n### High: `app.plugins` — 5 occurrences across 3 files\n\n`HAI3App` does not have a `plugins` property or `PluginManager`.\n\n**Files:** `api-reference/framework.md`, `api-reference/react.md`, `architecture/react.md`\n\n---\n\n### High: `presets.full` without function call — 5 occurrences across 3 files\n\nPresets are functions: `.use(full())` not `.use(presets.full)`.\n\n**Files:** `architecture/framework.md`, `architecture/react.md`, `architecture/app.md`\n\n---\n\n### Medium: `HAI3AppProps` type — still documented in `api-reference/react.md`\n\nDocuments props for the non-existent `<HAI3App>` component.\n\n---\n\n### Medium: `<Screen>` component — 1 occurrence in `architecture/react.md`\n\n---\n\n### Low: `@hai3/testing` — 1 occurrence in `concepts/screensets.md`\n\nPackage doesn't exist.\n\n---\n\n## Files That Need Updates\n\nThe fixes so far have been applied to a subset of files. Here are the **untouched files** that still contain multiple incorrect APIs:\n\n| File | Issues |\n|------|--------|\n| `hai3/architecture/framework.md` | `createPlugin`, `screensetPlugin`, `app.eventBus`, `app.getRegistry`, `app.id`, `presets.full` |\n| `hai3/architecture/react.md` | `useEventBus`, `<HAI3App>`, `defineScreenset`, `app.id`, `app.plugins`, `<Screen>`, `presets.full` |\n| `hai3/architecture/layers.md` | `useEventBus`, `<HAI3App>`, `defineScreenset`, `createPlugin`, `screensetPlugin`, `app.eventBus`, `app.id` |\n| `hai3/architecture/overview.md` | `createPlugin`, `screensetPlugin`, `app.eventBus`, `app.getRegistry` |\n| `hai3/architecture/sdk/screensets.md` | `defineScreenset` (16 occurrences — entire file) |\n| `hai3/concepts/event-driven.md` | `useEventBus` (13 occurrences — entire file) |\n| `hai3/concepts/screensets.md` | `defineScreenset`, `@hai3/testing` |\n| `hai3/concepts/themes.md` | `themePlugin` |\n| `hai3/guides/creating-screensets.md` | `useEventBus`, `<HAI3App>`, `defineScreenset` |\n| `hai3/guides/api-integration.md` | `apiPlugin`, `app.getRegistry` |\n| `case-studies/portal-microfrontend.md` | `useEventBus`, `<HAI3App>`, `defineScreenset` |\n| `hai3/api-reference/framework.md` | `screensetPlugin`, `app.getRegistry`, `app.eventBus`, `app.id`, `app.plugins` |\n\n---\n\n## Recommended Fix Strategy\n\n### Global find/replace (handles most issues):\n1. `useEventBus` → replace with `eventBus` direct import pattern\n2. `defineScreenset(...)` → replace with `ScreensetDefinition` type annotation\n3. `screensetPlugin` → `screensets()`, `themePlugin` → `themes()`, `routingPlugin` → `routing()`, `i18nPlugin` → `i18n()`, `apiPlugin` → removed (no api plugin), `layoutPlugin` → `layout()`\n4. `createPlugin({...})` → factory function pattern\n5. `<HAI3App` → `<HAI3Provider`\n6. `app.getRegistry('x')` → `app.xRegistry`\n7. `app.eventBus` → `eventBus` (direct import)\n8. `app.id` → `app.name` or remove\n9. `app.plugins` → remove\n10. `presets.full` → `full()`, `presets.minimal` → `minimal()`, `presets.headless` → `headless()`\n\n### Files requiring deeper rewrite:\n- `hai3/architecture/sdk/screensets.md` — entire file based on fictional API\n- `hai3/concepts/event-driven.md` — every example uses `useEventBus()`\n- `hai3/architecture/framework.md` — pervasive old plugin names\n\n---\n\n## Verdict\n\n**Requesting changes.** The files that were updated are correct and well-written. The same quality of updates needs to be applied to the remaining ~12 files listed above. The most impactful single change would be fixing `architecture/framework.md` and `concepts/event-driven.md`, as these are the two most-referenced architecture docs.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/157#pullrequestreview-3776590474","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/157","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/157#pullrequestreview-3776590474"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/157"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-10T03:59:06Z","commit_id":"43b0e2cabe602663ed2fd637775c5dca990fab80"}]},{"source_pr_number":156,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/156","source_state":"closed","source_author":"GeraBart","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #156] Fix/ide commands shipment fix","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"fix/ide_commands_shipment_fix","pr_head_sha":"ebad79c1a73e9d9e2ad344083166eb1dbc49fda9","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"GeraBart","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/156","id":3226936039,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQBxSA87AVyLn","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/156","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/156.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/156.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/issues/156","number":156,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix/ide commands shipment fix","user":{"login":"GeraBart","id":246844849,"node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ger