rfabric/cyberware-frontx/statuses/0a0919397348378c891a561164e0fc5cb976e813"}},"author_association":"MEMBER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},"source_issue_comments":[],"source_review_comments":[],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":148,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/148","source_state":"closed","source_author":"GuilleX7","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #148] feat: add improved navigation specs & reimplement routing strategies","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"feat/routing","pr_head_sha":"d938e0f6dc6592b9fc2ef365deb5f7e1e65a7633","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"GuilleX7","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/148","id":3202269230,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQBxSA86-3sAu","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/148","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/148.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/148.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/issues/148","number":148,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: add improved navigation specs & reimplement routing strategies","user":{"login":"GuilleX7","id":5785918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3ODU5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5785918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilleX7","html_url":"https://github.com/GuilleX7","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilleX7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilleX7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilleX7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilleX7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilleX7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilleX7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilleX7/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilleX7/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilleX7/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Routing Improvements: Parameterized URLs and Router Mode Configuration\r\n\r\nThis PR adds two major routing enhancements to HAI3:\r\n\r\n### 1. Parameterized URL Routing\r\n\r\nEnables screens to define custom URL patterns with named parameters (e.g., `/users/:id`, `/orders/:orderId/items/:itemId`). This is essential for deep linking, bookmarkable URLs, and RESTful URL patterns.\r\n\r\nHAI3 previously used flat routing (`/{base}/{screenId}`) with no parameter support, limiting the ability to create dynamic screens like user detail pages or order items.\r\n\r\n**Sample usage:**\r\n```ts\r\n// Define a parameterized route\r\n{\r\n  menuItem: { id: 'user-detail', label: 'User', path: '/users/:id' },\r\n  screen: () => import('./UserDetailScreen'),\r\n}\r\n\r\n// Access params in screen\r\nconst { id } = useRouteParams();\r\n\r\n// Navigate programmatically\r\nnavigateToScreen('demo', 'user-detail', { id: '123' });\r\n// → URL becomes /users/123\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 2. Router Mode Configuration\r\n\r\nAdds support for three routing modes: **browser** (default), **hash**, and **memory**. This enables HAI3 apps to work in different deployment scenarios.\r\n\r\n**Router modes:**\r\n- **Browser**: Clean URLs using HTML5 History API (`/dashboard`, `/users/123`) - best for production with server-side routing\r\n- **Hash**: URLs with hash fragments (`#/dashboard`, `#/users/123`) - ideal for static hosting without server configuration\r\n- **Memory**: In-memory routing without URL synchronization - perfect for testing, Electron apps, or embedded webviews\r\n\r\n**Sample usage:**\r\n```tsx\r\n// Browser router (default)\r\n<HAI3Provider>\r\n  <App />\r\n</HAI3Provider>\r\n\r\n// Hash router for static hosting\r\n<HAI3Provider router={{ type: 'hash' }}>\r\n  <App />\r\n</HAI3Provider>\r\n\r\n// Memory router for testing/embedded apps\r\n<HAI3Provider router={{ type: 'memory' }}>\r\n  <App />\r\n</HAI3Provider>\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Design Decisions\r\n\r\n**Parameterized Routing:**\r\n- `path-to-regexp` dependency (same lib used by Express/React Router)\r\n- Optional `path` property maintains full backward compatibility\r\n- React Context pattern for params (consistent with existing HAI3 patterns)\r\n- First-match-wins for route conflicts\r\n- Deterministic route matching: static routes prioritized over dynamic routes\r\n\r\n**Router Mode Configuration:**\r\n- Mode-aware URL helpers (getCurrentPath, updateURL) abstract routing logic\r\n- Appropriate event listeners per mode (`popstate` for browser, `hashchange` for hash)\r\n- Memory mode skips all URL synchronization for isolated environments\r\n- Configuration via `router` prop on HAI3Provider or `routerMode` in HAI3Config","created_at":"2026-01-23T07:49:24Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T08:38:03Z","closed_at":"2026-01-29T04:05:57Z","merged_at":"2026-01-29T04:05:57Z","merge_commit_sha":"2c5b8701af318825f0bd1c4cf6850935fae8a5eb","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/148/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/148/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/issues/148/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/statuses/d938e0f6dc6592b9fc2ef365deb5f7e1e65a7633","head":{"label":"GuilleX7:feat/routing","ref":"feat/routing","sha":"d938e0f6dc6592b9fc2ef365deb5f7e1e65a7633","user":{"login":"GuilleX7","id":5785918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3ODU5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://av