de_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjkxMTQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58691149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan","html_url":"https://github.com/dAlcaSan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Update AI guidelines to be UI kit agnostic, allowing projects to use any UI kit (shadcn-based, @hai3/uikit, or others) by configuring it in main.tsx and package.json.\r\n\r\nMotivation\r\n\r\nProjects should be able to swap UI kits without violating AI rules\r\nThe SDK architecture is agnostic - UI kit is a pluggable layer\r\nDefault UI kit ships with projects, but users can change it\r\n\r\nKey Changes\r\n\r\nREPO INVARIANTS: hai3/uikit → \"the configured UI kit\"\r\nIMPORT RULES: hai3/uikit → \"the configured UI kit\"\r\nPRE-DIFF CHECKLIST: References now say \"configured UI kit\"\r\nCLI PROJECT GENERATOR: Clarified that default UI kit is included, users can swap in main.tsx\r\nUIKIT.md CRITICAL RULES: Removed shadcn-specific references, now fully agnostic\r\n\r\nPhilosophy\r\n\r\nDefault UI kit ships with every project (currently hai3/uikit)\r\nUsers can swap by editing main.tsx imports and package.json dependencies\r\nRules are agnostic - they apply regardless of which UI kit is configured","created_at":"2026-01-14T15:27:23Z","updated_at":"2026-01-15T02:50:49Z","closed_at":"