"pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/133","id":3163080629,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQBxSA868iMe1","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/133","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/133.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/133.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/issues/133","number":133,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(cli): conditionally generate App.tsx based on studio flag","user":{"login":"dAlcaSan","id":58691149,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjkxMTQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58691149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan","html_url":"https://github.com/dAlcaSan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dAlcaSan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Problem\r\nProjects created with `--no-studio` failed to build because App.tsx imported `@hai3/studio` even though the dependency wasn't installed.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\nCreated two App.tsx templates and select the correct one based on the `--studio` flag:\r\n- [App.tsx](cci:7://file:///Users/david/Development/Dev-HAI3/src/app/App.tsx:0:0-0:0) - includes StudioOverlay\r\n- [App.no-studio.tsx](cci:7://file:///Users/david/Development/Dev-HAI3/src/app/App.no-studio.tsx