-event-horizon","html_url":"https://github.com/beyond-event-horizon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"CLI tools implemented. Templates are populated at build time from the project folders.\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n\r\nUsage: hai3 [options] [command]\r\nHAI3 CLI - Project scaffolding and screenset management\r\nOptions:\r\n  -V, --version                    output the version number\r\n  -q, --quiet                      Suppress non-essential output\r\n  -h, --help                       display help for command\r\nCommands:\r\n  create [options] <project-name>  Create a new HAI3 project\r\n  update                           Update HAI3 CLI and project packages\r\n  screenset                        Screenset management commands\r\n  help [command]                   display help for command\r\n\r\nUsage: hai3 screenset [options] [command]\r\nScreenset management commands\r\nOptions:\r\n  -h, --help                        display help for command\r\nCommands:\r\n  create [options] <name>           Create a new screenset with an initial screen\r\n  copy [options] <source> <target>  Copy an existing screenset with transformed IDs","created_at":"2025-11-24T15:12:59Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T16:20:47Z","closed_at":