b.com/beyond-event-horizon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beyond-event-horizon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<img width=\"1511\" height=\"825\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-11-19 at 12 44 19 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/209100f7-7a0f-420c-b565-a3b2b3f8dd7c\" />\r\n<img width=\"1512\" height=\"826\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-11-19 at 12 44 44 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e0a51e1-e115-4ce5-8174-c026a20f4ec9\" />\r\n\r\n- Separated dev tools to a separate package\r\n- Devtools are automatically excluded from prod build\r\n- Plug & play approach: @hai3/devtools package needs to be added to a project \"devDependencies\", and dev tools will appear automatically in dev mode without any setup\r\n- Devtools panel is resizable and draggable. Toggle state, position and size are stored in local storage\r\n- Devtools toggle button is draggable. It's position is stored in local storage\r\n- Hotkeys support: devtools panel can be toggled by pressing \"Shift+`\".","created_at":"2025-11-18T16:49:30Z","updated_at":"2025-11-19T12:56:57Z","closed_at":"2025-11-19T12:56:57Z","merged_at":"2025-11-19T12:56:57Z","merge_commit_sha":"f1adb53133550611f060052b82268b6ded2ff963","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"l