data sharing between screensets\n+- READ core state, CANNOT MODIFY core state\n+- NO hardcoded screenset names in shared code\n+- NO `if screenset ==` conditionals\n+- Build from UI Kit + UI Core only\n+\n+**UI Kit & Themes:**\n+- CAN add NEW UI Kit components (follow .ai/UIKIT.md)\n+- CANNOT modify existing UI Kit components\n+- CAN add NEW themes (follow .ai/THEMES.md)\n+- CANNOT modify existing themes\n+- NO hardcoded colors - use theme tokens\n+\n+**Building Screens:**\n+- ALWAYS use UI Kit components","path":".ai/targets/SCREENSETS.md","commit_id":"173e39f62c4f80898f1ca21ae9642e2ca067c72d","original_commit_id":"a78a908aff786c72067841bda5e4e2c53d899445","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"... global or local","created_at":"2025-10-23T17:49:35Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T18:05:50Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/3#discussion_r2456418249","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/3","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/comments/245641824