Sidebar)\n+- Screen = UI Kit + business logic + screenset state\n+- Styling: ONLY layout (flex, grid, gap) - NO visual styles (see .ai/STYLING.md)\n+\n+**Data Simulation:**\n+- Mock data in `data.ts`\n+- API simulation in `api.ts`\n+- Simulate async with setTimeout\n+- Handle loading/error states\n+\n+**Draft Screenset:**\n+- Wireframes, NOT pixel-perfect","path":".ai/targets/SCREENSETS.md","commit_id":"3151d02ef67fb7ddde940604a40f3aa181b257de","original_commit_id":"a78a908aff786c72067841bda5e4e2c53d899445","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I think we do no need this, let it try to be pixel-perfect, if it can...","created_at":"2025-10-23T17:52:54Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T18:05:50Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/3#discussion_r2456453213","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/3","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pulls/comments/2456453213"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-frontx/pull/3#discussion_r2456453213"},